@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 001 活動與組別進場：組件圖（技術層）

actor "老師" as Teacher
actor "學生" as Student

component "老師端畫面" as TeacherUI
component "學生端畫面" as StudentUI

package "搶答系統（伺服器）" as Server {
  component "身分驗證\n(Access Control)" as Auth
  component "組別管理\n(Group Registry)" as Groups
  component "活動階段管理\n(Activity Phase Manager)" as Phase
  component "倒數計時\n(Countdown)" as Timer
  component "指令路由\n(Command Router)" as Router
  component "狀態同步\n(State Broadcaster)" as Sync
  database "活動資料儲存\n(Activity Store)" as Store
}

note right of TeacherUI
  web/src/features/teacher/
  TeacherPage.tsx、TeacherLogin.tsx
  GroupManager.tsx、PhaseControl.tsx
  倒數顯示：web/src/features/shared/Countdown.tsx
end note

note right of StudentUI
  web/src/features/student/
  StudentPage.tsx、GroupPicker.tsx
  倒數顯示：web/src/features/shared/Countdown.tsx
end note

note right of Auth
  server/src/app/access.ts
  server/src/infra/http/authRoutes.ts
  server/src/app/studentCommands.ts
end note

note right of Groups
  server/src/domain/groupRegistry.ts
  server/src/app/groupCommands.ts
end note

note right of Phase
  server/src/domain/activity.ts
  server/src/app/activityCommands.ts
end note

note right of Timer
  server/src/app/countdown.ts
end note

note right of Router
  server/src/infra/socket/commandRouter.ts
  檢查順序：zod schema → 身分 → 用例
  成功 Ack 才呼叫 broadcastState()
end note

note right of Sync
  server/src/app/snapshot.ts
  server/src/infra/socket/broadcaster.ts
  server/src/app/presence.ts
end note

note right of Store
  server/src/infra/db/database.ts
  server/src/infra/db/activityRepo.ts
  server/src/infra/db/groupRepo.ts
  server/src/infra/db/sessionRepo.ts
end note

Teacher --> TeacherUI
Student --> StudentUI

TeacherUI --> Auth : POST /api/teacher/login
StudentUI --> Auth : POST /api/student/join
Auth --> Store : insertSession / findSession；\n進場前以 getGroupById 確認組別

TeacherUI --> Router : sendCommand：group:*、activity:*
StudentUI --> Router : sendCommand：student:leave
Router --> Auth : student:leave → leaveGroup()
Router --> Groups : group:create / group:rename / group:delete
Router --> Phase : activity:open / activity:close / activity:reset
Router --> Sync : Ack ok 後 broadcastState()

Sync --> Auth : resolveIdentity(token)
Groups --> Store : groupRepo / activityRepo
Phase --> Store : activityRepo / countGroups
Phase --> Timer : onOpened / onClosed
Timer --> Phase : 經 index.ts：onExpire → closeExpiredActivity()
Groups --> Sync : 經 index.ts：onGroupDeleted → invalidateGroup()
Timer --> Sync : 經 index.ts：到期且改變時 broadcastState()
Sync --> Store : 讀取 activity / groups；presence 改變時更新 revision

Sync --> TeacherUI : state（依身分過濾的 Snapshot）
Sync --> StudentUI : state／session:invalid

note bottom of Phase
  階段只能由伺服器改變：
  準備中 → 搶答中 → 已結束
  domain/activity.ts：open() → close() → reset()
end note
@enduml
